  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The van der Waal's constant 'b' of a gas is <math> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mi>π</mi> <mo>×</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mo>L/mol</mo> </mrow> </math>. How near can the centres of the two molecules approach each other ? [Use : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></math>]</p>\r",
